On Bitcoin consensus (thread 1)

@Excellion: Consensus in Bitcoin is not agreement. It's a wide range of self-interested actors (noderunners, miners, exchanges, devs) doing what they think is in their own best economic interests and happening to converge on the same chain. It's emergent, not decided. It can't be forced.
